Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Put the pieces together:\Nthe machine this study proposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}A {\c&HF09CB4&}wind{\c&HF7F4F2&} carries noise to a symmetric\Ncrowd of codes, mirror built in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}A decoder turns each code into hill maps,\Nso every field is divergence-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}And the energy budget\Nis imposed on the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:24.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}It has not been built as a whole:\Nthe experiments tested pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:30.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}on three dials and a flat sheet, with\Nsmall networks on an ordinary processor.
